WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.637
Two-Tier Tax Justice: How CRA Protects the Wealthy and Punishes Workers.

00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:11.862
Our grandfathers paid their taxes and built this country — the roads, the hospitals, the schools.

00:00:11.862 --> 00:00:20.250
Now the ultra-wealthy hide billions in offshore accounts while CRA audits working families for $500 home-office deductions.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.325
The numbers prove it.

00:00:22.325 --> 00:00:30.000
Every figure on this page comes from CRA's own reports, the Parliamentary Budget Officer, and the Auditor General.
